# EdgeLens run outputs. The default filenames are covered explicitly,
# but ad hoc names from manual testing (before.json, t.json, etc.) are
# NOT auto-matched by pattern — safer to save test runs into a runs/
# subfolder (ignored wholesale below) than to rely on naming conventions.
runs/
edgelens_benchmark*.json
edgelens_report*.html
edgelens_report*.json
*.diagnosis.json
